<P>To post news simply click on the Submit link under the news section in the main menu on the left of your screen.  To simply post events in the calendar click on the Calendar link at the top and you will be able to submit calendar events.  The same goes for our gallery as well.

<P>What can you post?  Birthday news, events, gatherings, raids, crafting parties, guild leader announcements.  <B>Almost anything is allowed as long as it's clean and relavent to the community (Note I say community, so if you have something that you think your server would enjoy but its for another game, post! We'll check it out.  Maximum time news is posted from your submission in 20 hours.)</B>

<P>And don't forget about the other features such as submitting your guild for a guild slot in the forums on your server, chatting in dedicated server chat rooms (each server gets its own!), and much more.  If you have any questions you may contact us at <a href="mailto:admin@eq2servers.com">admin@eq2servers.com</a>, or read our <a href="http://www.eq2servers.com/modules.php?name=FAQ">Network FAQ</a>.
